{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Sleepless Night"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le06ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Phrasal Verbs about Staying Healthy"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are many phrasal verbs that are used to talk about staying healthy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Phrasal Verbs are verbs that are combined with one or two particles (a preposition or adverb), for example, 'in' or 'out', to make verbs with new meanings. These new meanings are usually non-literal. For example, <span class=\"strong\">to throw</span> means to send something through the air (He <span class=\"strong\">threw</span> the pen to me) but to <span class=\"strong\">throw up</span> means to vomit or be sick (<span class=\"italic\">She was really ill after eating that seafood and she <span class=\"strong\">threw up</span>.)</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Phrasal Verb</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning and Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">build up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"increase or become larger or stronger<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: It takes regular hard work to <span class=\\\"strong\\\">build up</span> your muscles from exercising.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">put on</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"increase how much you weigh, to get fatter or heavier<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I really need to go on a diet. I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">put on</span> so much weight over the holidays.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">take up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"start doing an activity, hobby or job<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I'm going to <span class=\\\"strong\\\">take up</span> tennis this summer. I've never played it before but I think I'll like it.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">cut out</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stop eating or drinking something to improve your health<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: He's <span class=\\\"strong\\\">cut out sweets and chocolates</span> and has already lost quite a bit of weight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">give up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stop doing or using something that has been a habit to improve your health<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">gave up meat</span> 10 years ago and feel so much healthier now that I'm a vegetarian.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " \u201cIf\u201d Clauses with Modals to Give Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use modals like  <span class=\"italic\">should</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, and  <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> to give advice. You can also use an  <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause before the modal to describe a condition that you're giving advice for."}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Simple Present + <span class=\"italic\">should</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Simple Past + <span class=\"italic\">would</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Present Continuous + <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I think I should take up jogging or something to lose weight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + should \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you're so tired, you should go to bed early.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I were you, I would go to bed early.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + ought to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you're working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short sleep during the day to get rest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you're not working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon to rest."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a healthy lifestyle to relieve stress."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to catch up on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to do something you didn't do enough of before"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was sick last week, so I need to catch up on my work. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beauty sleep"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " an expression based on the belief that more sleep makes you more beautiful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I wish I could catch up on my beauty sleep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to put on (weight)"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a polite way to talk about getting heavier"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to do more exercise because I feel like I've put on weight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to work off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get rid of excess calories or weight"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to work off the calories from my heavy meal. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "give me a break"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a casual expression to tell someone to not be so harsh on you"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Give me a break. I want to be healthy, but some fast food is fun to eat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss some advice that friends or family have given you on how to take your mind off of stress from your job or school work. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down as many pieces of advice as you can."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do research from the internet to find other ways to take away stress and live a healthy life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 more pieces of advice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "