xercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, Sally.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, Vanessa. What's up?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm just waking up. I had a late night at the restaurant. I wish I could catch up on my beauty sleep, but I have an early morning yoga class.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you're not working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "21000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That sounds like a very good idea. What's going on with you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I actually didn't sleep much at all last night.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why? What happened?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure. I think work was on my mind a lot, and I had a heavy meal late in the evening. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If writing is on your mind, you should do something relaxing in the evening.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "42000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Right. I think I should take up jogging or something because I feel like I've put on weight.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You'd better cut out the poutine as well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Give me a break. I don't want to pass out while I'm running. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You won't, but you don't want to work out just to work off the calories you consume.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Fine. I'll give it up. If I cut down on the sweets, my weight should be fine.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}